    "title": "Carolyn Stevens Henrie - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Carolyn Stevens Henrie, beloved mother, grandmother, great-grandmother, wife, and friend, passed away peacefully at her home in Sutherland, Utah September 23, 2026 at the age of 77, surrounded by her loving family. She was born on April 10, 1949, in Holden, Utah, to Earl O. Stevens and Lola McKee Stevens.... Read full article",
